WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.072
Zhuge Liang was on his northern campaign when he suddenly heard bad news: Jieting had fallen, and everyone in camp was anxious.

00:00:06.422 --> 00:00:10.694
The soldiers looked at one another, not knowing what to do.

00:00:11.044 --> 00:00:15.316
Sima Yi came toward Xicheng with a great many soldiers, dust flying everywhere.

00:00:15.666 --> 00:00:20.994
Seen from afar, the army looked like a long river with no end in sight.

00:00:21.344 --> 00:00:27.464
But there were no soldiers in Xicheng — yet the city gates stood wide open, and the streets were completely empty.

00:00:27.814 --> 00:00:33.934
Zhuge Liang sat alone atop the city wall, playing the qin with a smile on his face, not afraid at all.

00:00:34.284 --> 00:00:39.156
The sound of the qin drifted slowly beyond the walls — quiet and crystal clear.

00:00:39.506 --> 00:00:45.794
Sima Yi watched from afar and thought: Zhuge Liang is so calm — there must be an ambush!

00:00:46.144 --> 00:00:50.824
So Sima Yi quickly gave the order to withdraw — not one soldier dared enter the city.

00:00:51.174 --> 00:00:55.254
The great army turned and left, its footsteps slowly fading into the distance.

00:00:55.604 --> 00:01:00.596
The sun went down, and Xicheng was quiet. The Empty Fort Strategy had worked!

